  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Run feed-forward, history and recurrent (GRU/LSTM) PPO agents through seeded partially observable dungeons, watch their observations, discovered maps and hidden states, then fork an episode and change the treatment branch's retained memory to test whether memory causes escape success, alongside recorded comparison, ablation and generalisation results. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
